 ["Learn spell Mountain Stance\\nReduce Damage taken by 30% and increases your max health by 25% for 10 seconds"] = "Aprende a magia Mountain Stance.\\nReduz o dano recebido em 30% e aumenta a vida máxima em 25% por 10 segundos",
 ["Learn spell Phoenix Wrath"] = "Aprende a magia Phoenix Wrath",
 ["Learn spell Sacred Ground"] = "Aprende a magia Sacred Ground",
 ["Learn spell Shockwave"] = "Aprende a magia Shockwave",
 ["Learn spell Swarn of Insects\\nPlace a swarm of insects on a target increasing it's damage received by 10% (por nível) from all sources."] = "Learn magia Swarn of Insects\\nPlace a swarm of insects on a alvo increasing it's dano received by 10% (por nível) from todos sources.",
 ["Learn spell Void Execution"] = "Aprende a magia Void Execution",
 ["Learn spell Zen Barrier\\nPlace a serenity sphere on a chosen player for 8 seconds. Each time they take damage, the sphere absorbs the damage and instantly heals them for the same amount."] = "Aprende a magia Zen Barrier.\\nColoca uma esfera de serenidade em um jogador escolhido por 8 segundos. Cada vez que recebe dano, a esfera o absorve e cura imediatamente pelo mesmo valor.",
